Footprinting ke baad next logical step hai Scanning.

16. Scanning kya hai?

Scanning mein target network/system ko probe karke information obtain ki jaati hai.

Main objectives:

Live hosts find karna
Open ports identify karna
Services identify karna
Versions identify karna
Potential vulnerabilities identify karna
17. Ports kya hote hain?

