18. Port States

Scanning mein commonly:

Open

Port par service listen kar rahi hai.

Closed

Port reachable hai but koi service listen nahi kar rahi.

Filtered

Firewall/filtering ki wajah se scanner clearly determine nahi kar pa raha.

19. Nmap ⭐⭐⭐

Nmap = Network Mapper

Network discovery aur security auditing ke liye commonly used tool.

Nmap se:

Hosts discover
Ports scan
Services identify
Versions detect
OS information estimate
Scripts ke through additional checks

kiye ja sakte hain.

Important concepts:

Host Discovery → Kaunse systems alive hain?

Port Scanning → Kaunse ports open hain?

Service Detection → Port par kaunsi service chal rahi hai?

Version Detection → Service ka version kya hai?

20. HTTP/HTTPS

Sir ke scanning/enum material mein:

80 → HTTP
443 → HTTPS

HTTP web communication ke liye use hota hai.

Common HTTP methods:

GET → data/resource retrieve
POST → data submit
PUT → resource update/replace
PATCH → partial update
DELETE → resource delete
HEAD → headers only
OPTIONS → supported communication options
TRACE → diagnostic request
CONNECT → tunnel establish
